,"Rava said"],[2,3,"without"],[3,11,"“the first part of them” … also … you cannot say … means … all … one grain.","<b>“the first part of them”</b> there is <b>also</b> no difficulty, as <b>you cannot say</b> the term “grain” <b>means</b> that <b>all</b> the different types of grain are considered <b>one grain.</b>"],[12,13,"Granted,"],[13,14,"there,"],[14,15,"we say"],[15,17,"“or the flock” means"],[17,18,"all"],[18,20,"are one flock."],[20,23,"Because if it enters your mind"],[23,25,"sheep and goats"],[25,26,"also"],[26,27,"let … write:","<b>let</b> the verse <b>write:</b>"],[27,30,"And all the animal tithe,"]],"w":{"0":"Rava","1":"said","2":"without","3":"the first part of them","4":"also","6":"all","7":"means … grain","8":"one","10":"you cannot say","12":"Granted","13":"there","14":"we say","15":"or the flock means","17":"all","18":"flock","19":"are one","20":"Because if","21":"it enters","22":"your mind","23":"sheep","24":"and goats","25":"also","26":"let … write","27":"And all","28":"the … tithe","29":"animal"},"g":[[3,5,"גם כן","a"],[9,12,"אין אתה יכול לומר","a"],[12,15,"נניח שם אומרים אנו","a"],[20,23,"שאם עולה על דעתך","a"],[24,26,"גם כן","a"],[26,27,"שתכתוב","a"]]},{"k":"b4bd9e8c87a8","n":15,"p":[[0,2,"And if you would say"],[2,3,"if"],[3,4,"had written:"],[4,8,"All the animal tithe,"],[8,9,"I would say"],[9,11,"even to undomesticated animals,"],[13,15,"derives … from sacrificial … under … under","<b>derives</b> the <i>halakha</i> of the animal tithe <b>from sacrificial</b> animals, via a verbal analogy of the terms “under” and “under.” With regard to sacrificial animals it states: “When a bull, or a sheep, or a goat is brought forth, then it shall be seven days <b>under</b> its mother, but from the eighth day onward it may be accepted for an offering made by fire to the Lord” (Leviticus 22:27), and with regard to animal tithe it states: “And all the tithe of the herd or the flock, whatever passes <b>under</b>"]],"w":{"0":"And if … would","1":"you … say","2